---
title: "C12 — Atomic cross-list move · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Move[Move request] --> Lock[Lock and verify source, destination and anchors]
  Lock --> Version{Expected versions current?}
  Version -->|No| Conflict[409; no partial move]
  Version -->|Yes| Explicit{Explicit destination status supplied?}
  Explicit -->|Yes| CheckStatus[Require that status in destination]
  Explicit -->|No| Keep{Current status visible there?}
  Keep -->|Yes| Fields[Apply destination field corrections]
  Keep -->|No| Category{Same-category destination status exists?}
  Category -->|No| Invalid[400; no partial move]
  Category -->|Yes| First[Choose first by resolved order]
  First --> Fields
  CheckStatus -->|Unavailable| Invalid
  CheckStatus -->|Available| Fields
  Fields --> Validate[Validate all fields, assignees and placement]
  Validate -->|Invalid| Invalid
  Validate -->|Valid| Commit[Write list, status, order, versions and outbox]
  Clear[Source-only keys need explicit clearing] -. invariant .-> Fields
